      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the list. one thing is that the spikes are really erratic—they appear and disappear very suddenly, almost like the sensor is just glitching out or being hit by something intermittently. i'm trying to figure out if there's a way to statistically model these sudden \"glitchy\" jumps to see if they're just random noise or something more systematic about the instrument's behavior.",
